# AVD-KSV-0119 (NET_RAW capability added)
#
# network-exporter (syepes/network_exporter) needs raw sockets to run its
# ICMP/MTR probes. Its securityContext already drops ALL capabilities and
# explicitly re-adds only NET_ADMIN and NET_RAW (see
# kubernetes/network-exporter/values.yaml).
#
# Inline `# trivy:ignore:AVD-KSV-0119` comments and path-scoped
# .trivyignore.yaml entries do not suppress this specific check when
# scanning Helm-rendered manifests (trivy misattributes the finding's
# location to an unrelated resource), so it is ignored globally here
# instead. This also silences the same finding for netforge-be's
# celery-worker and conductor-worker containers, which also add NET_RAW.
#
# Both ID forms are listed because the trivy version used by some
# runners (e.g. trivy-runner) prints the short form "KSV-0119" in the
# report while others print "AVD-KSV-0119" - the ignorefile matcher
# requires an exact string match against whichever form is printed.
AVD-KSV-0119
KSV-0119
